  "description": "Data quality, especially specificity and clarity, is crucial for self-supervised model training. \n               We introduce Hyperbolic Entailment Filtering (<strong>HYPE</strong>) for images and texts, with state-of-the-art performance in \n               the <a href=\"https://www.datacomp.ai/dcclip/leaderboard.html\">DataComp benchmark</a>."
